 represent an array"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of any kind of items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The section"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also able to handle all end-user interaction with the generated cells, including adding,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing, deleting, and moving the cells. When cells are added or edited, detail views are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"automatically generated for this purpose. To enable adding cells, the class’ user should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set the addButtonItem property of the section to a valid UIBarButtonItem, the section then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will automatically add new items when the button is tapped.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfItemsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SCArrayOfItemsSection"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"role":"collection","title":"STV","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","abstract":[{"text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfItemsSection/itemRemovedAtIndex:":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"itemRemovedAtIndex:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfItemsSection\/itemRemovedAtIndex:","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofitemssection\/itemremovedatindex:","title":"itemRemovedAtIndex:","abstract":[{"text":"Subclasses should override this method to handle an item that got removed (method called internally by framework)","type":"text"}]}}}